 {
  "id": "gid://shopify/Product/16147896172874",
  "title": "Cat Harness with Adjustable Leash and Collar",
  "handle": "cat-harness-with-adjustable-leash-and-collar",
  "status": "DRAFT",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Introducing the ultimate solution for adventurous cat owners\u2014the <strong>Cat Harness and Leash Set</strong>. Designed with your feline's comfort and safety in mind, this innovative harness is perfect for taking your cat on walks, hikes, or simply exploring the great outdoors.</p><p>\n\n</p><p>Crafted from <strong>double layer polyester mesh fabric</strong>, the harness ensures a breathable and comfortable fit. The adjustable collar allows for a customized fit, accommodating cats of various sizes. Available in three sizes\u2014S, M, and L\u2014you can easily find the perfect fit for your furry friend:</p><p>\n\n</p><p><br></p><p>\n\n</p><p>With a secure design that prevents escape, your cat will feel safe as they explore their surroundings. The vibrant <strong>red color</strong> not only enhances visibility but also adds a stylish touch to your cat\u2019s outdoor gear.</p><p>\n\n</p><p>Check out these images for a closer look:</p><p>\n</p><p>\n    <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB18GfTKpXXXXajXFXXq6xXFXXXD/223125241/HTB18GfTKpXXXXajXFXXq6xXFXXXD.jpg\" alt=\"Cat Harness Image 1\">\n    <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1xAz7KpXXXXa6XXXXq6xXFXXXc/223125241/HTB1xAz7KpXXXXa6XXXXq6xXFXXXc.jpg\" alt=\"Cat Harness Image 2\">\n    <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB17cYDKpXXXXaRaXXXq6xXFXXXE/223125241/HTB17cYDKpXXXXaRaXXXq6xXFXXXE.jpg\" alt=\"Cat Harness Image 3\">\n    <img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB18A7jHFXXXXcGXFXXq6xXFXXXc/223125241/HTB18A7jHFXXXXcGXFXXq6xXFXXXc.jpg\" alt=\"Cat Harness Image 4\">\n</p><p>\n\n</p><p>Whether your cat is a natural explorer or just needs a little nudge to get outside, this harness is the perfect choice. Don't miss out on the opportunity to enjoy outdoor adventures together!</p>",
