  "status": "DRAFT",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Give your cat hours of fun with our <strong>Interactive Flapping Bird Cat Toy</strong>\u2014the perfect companion for indoor play.</p><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p><strong>Engaging Flapping Motion:</strong> Designed to simulate the natural movement of a bird, this toy flaps automatically, captivating your cat\u2019s attention and encouraging active play.</p><p><strong>High-Quality Material:</strong> Made from soft, durable plush fabric, this toy is gentle on your cat's paws and built to withstand hours of playtime.</p><p><strong>USB Rechargeable:</strong> Equipped with a built-in battery, this toy is easily rechargeable via USB, eliminating the need for constant battery replacements and ensuring long-lasting fun.</p><p><strong>Compact and Portable:</strong> Measuring 17cm, this toy is perfectly sized for cats of all ages. Its compact design makes it easy to carry and store, so your cat can enjoy it anywhere.</p><p><strong>Product Specifications:</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Package Includes:</strong></p><p><br></p><p>Keep your cat entertained and enriched with this interactive and durable toy, designed to stimulate their natural hunting instincts while providing endless fun.</p>",
