  "status": "DRAFT",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Keep your cat active, engaged, and entertained with the <strong>Interactive Indoor Cat Ball Toy</strong>\u2014a smart motion toy designed for endless indoor fun. With random rolling movements and two adjustable speed modes, this rechargeable toy stimulates your cat\u2019s natural hunting instincts, providing hours of exercise and excitement.</p><p>The <strong>360\u00b0 rolling action</strong> changes direction automatically when it encounters obstacles, creating an unpredictable and fun playtime experience. Powered by a <strong>USB-rechargeable 150mAh lithium battery</strong>, it offers up to <strong>120 minutes of play</strong> on a single charge.</p><p>Crafted with a <strong>smooth, easy-to-clean surface</strong>, this toy is perfect for cats of all sizes and ages. Just wipe it down with a damp cloth, and it's ready for the next round of fun.</p><p><strong>Features:</strong></p><p>Interactive motion and random direction changes</p><p><strong>Dual-speed adjustment</strong> for customized play</p><p><strong>360\u00b0 rolling</strong> with obstacle avoidance</p><p><strong>USB rechargeable</strong> (150mAh battery, up to 120 minutes playtime)</p><p>Durable, easy-to-clean surface</p><p>Great for indoor cats of all ages</p><p>Give your feline friend a fun and healthy outlet for their energy\u2014with Interactive Indoor Cat Ball Toy, playtime just got smarter.</p>",
