  "title": "Dog Toy, Tug Rope Toy, Training Ball",
  "handle": "dog-toy-tug-rope-toy-training-ball",
  "status": "DRAFT",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>\n    Unleash your furry friend's playtime potential with our <strong>Durable Dog Toy</strong> designed for endless fun and training opportunities! Made from high-quality <strong>TPR</strong> material, this <strong>knot toy</strong> is perfect for tug-of-war games, fetch sessions, and even obedience training.\n</p><p>\n</p><p>\n    Its unique design ensures that your dog can enjoy a good chew without compromising their safety. The vibrant color options make it visually appealing, while the robust construction promises long-lasting use. \n</p><p>\n</p><p>\n    This versatile toy not only provides entertainment but also helps promote healthy chewing habits and strengthens the bond between you and your pet. \n</p><p>\n</p><p>\n    Take a look at the images below to see how this toy can bring joy to your dog's life:\n</p><p>\n</p><p>\n    <img src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/2020/179/694/16461496971_1239140619.jpg\" alt=\"Durable Dog Toy\" width=\"790\" height=\"573.5729166666666\"></p><p>\n    <img src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/2020/818/017/16408710818_1239140619.jpg\" alt=\"Durable Dog Toy in action\" width=\"790\" height=\"420.51041666666663\"></p><p>\n    <img src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/2020/537/617/16408716735_1239140619.jpg\" alt=\"Dog enjoying the toy\" width=\"790\" height=\"632\"></p><p>\n    <img src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/2020/799/694/16461496997_1239140619.jpg\" alt=\"Strong and durable design\" width=\"790\" height=\"694.5054945054945\"></p><p>\n    <img src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/2020/301/647/16408746103_1239140619.jpg\" alt=\"Perfect for training\" width=\"790\" height=\"632\"></p><p>\n    <img src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/2020/290/566/16527665092_1239140619.jpg\" alt=\"Colorful and fun\" width=\"790\" height=\"623.359375\">\n</p><p>\n</p><p>\n    Elevate your dog's playtime experience with our <strong>Training Ball Toy</strong>! Perfect for dogs of all sizes, this toy is the ideal combination of fun and functionality. <strong>Order now</strong> to give your pet the joy they deserve!\n</p>",
