  "handle": "steam-pet-brush",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>This innovative steam pet brush is a revolutionary grooming tool for cats and dogs.It combines three essential functions in one convenient device. \u00a0The brush emits warm steam that helps to loosen dirt, dander, and matted fur, making grooming easier and more comfortable for your pet. The specially designed bristles effectively remove loose hair, minimizing shedding around your home. The gentle vibrations and warm steam provide a soothing massage that helps to relax your pet and reduce stress. 1 This multi-functional brush is easy to use and helps to keep your pet's coat healthy, shiny, and tangle-free.</p><p>Applicable object: Dog</p><p>Style: 20ml single bottle, 20ml boxed, 20ml suit</p><p>Ingredients: deionized water, glycerin, coconut oil, tea tree oil, yellow herb extract</p><p>Type: Wash-Free essence</p>",
