 {
  "id": "gid://shopify/Product/16147899220298",
  "title": "Dog Snuffle Mat for Pet Enrichment and Training",
  "handle": "dog-snuffle-mat-for-pet-enrichment-and-training",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Unleash your pet\u2019s inner detective with our <strong>Smelling Pad</strong>, a perfect blend of fun and mental stimulation! Designed to engage your furry friend\u2019s natural instincts, this innovative sniffing mat is an essential tool for pet owners looking to provide their pets with a challenging yet enjoyable experience.</p><p><br></p><p>\n\nCrafted from high-quality <strong>terylene</strong>, the Smelling Pad is not only durable but also easy to clean, ensuring a hygienic play environment for your pet. Measuring at a generous <strong>70*50cm</strong>, it offers plenty of space for your pet to explore and interact with their surroundings.</p><p><br></p><p>\n\n<img src=\"https://static.hzpdex.com/35747c49-975b-41df-a5ed-bccff3111aef.png\" alt=\"Smelling Pad Image 1\"></p><p>\n<img style=\"max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://res.race321.com/pro/4770776800848724536/3773b74f.jpg\" alt=\"Smelling Pad Image 2\"></p><p>\n<img style=\"max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://res.race321.com/pro/4770776800848724536/4131f8b2.jpg\" alt=\"Smelling Pad Image 3\"></p><p>\n<img style=\"max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://res.race321.com/pro/4770776800848724536/c50830ac.jpg\" alt=\"Smelling Pad Image 4\"></p><p>\n<img style=\"max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://res.race321.com/pro/4770776800848724536/7e4070bf.jpg\" alt=\"Smelling Pad Image 5\"></p><p>\n<img style=\"max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://res.race321.com/pro/4770776800848724536/8513bdf0.jpg\" alt=\"Smelling Pad Image 6\"></p><p>\n<img src=\"https://static.hzpdex.com/ef6e13db-6666-4eb8-9698-fd922b8249dc.png\" alt=\"Smelling Pad Image 7\"></p><p>\n\nAvailable in a stunning <strong>Purple</strong> color, this mat not only captivates your pet's attention but also adds a touch of style to your home. Whether you are using it for slow feeding, training, or simply to relieve stress, the Smelling Pad is the perfect companion for your pet's daily activities.</p><p><br></p><p>\n\nGive your pet the gift of <strong>mental exercise</strong> and fun with our Smelling Pad. It\u2019s more than just a toy; it\u2019s a pathway to a happier, healthier pet!</p>",
